"of both packages."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid "B<-w, --warn>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux
msgid ""
"Print a warning instead of a regular message in case of soname differences."
msgstr ""

